OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold, bright start across the
OL,6,Fregion. Cloud builds at times through
OL,7,Fthe day but remaining dry with good
OL,8,Fsunny spells. Warm in the sun by mid
OL,9,Fafternoon. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FFine and partly cloudy
OL,12,Finitially. Cloud breaks to give a
OL,13,Fclear night with the odd mist and fog
OL,14,Fpatch developing. Another cool night
OL,15,Flikely.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FWidely clear and dry to start
OL,18,Facross the region, cloud slowly builds
OL,19,Fbut a further pleasant and very warm
OL,20,Fday in prospect. Cloudier overnight
OL,21,Fwith some light rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
