OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FDrier
OL,6,Fand brighter through Saturday. Mostly
OL,7,Ffine but breezy on Sunday, with light
OL,8,Frain arriving during the evening. A
OL,9,Ffurther fine day on Monday.
OL,10,FTemperatures around average.
